<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>404 — 页面未找到</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="5;url=/zh/" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    :root {
      --bg: #0c0b0a;
      --text: #e4ddd3;
      --text-2: #9a9088;
      --amber: #b88a3f;
      --line: rgba(235, 220, 190, 0.07);
      --font-sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(235,220,190,0.022) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(235,220,190,0.022) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 10px 10px;
    }
    .wrap { text-align: center; }
    .code {
      font-size: 4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--amber);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .msg { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-2); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .links a {
      color: var(--amber);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(184, 138, 63, 0.3);
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .links a:hover {
      background: rgba(184, 138, 63, 0.1);
      border-color: var(--amber);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="code">404</div>
    <p class="msg">您访问的页面不存在。</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="/zh/">返回首页</a>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
